{"id":598,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"夢に伴走する実践的なキャリア教育","feature_description":"郁文館は、「夢を持たせ、夢を追わせ、夢を叶えさせる」ことを掲げ、人間力・学力・グローバル力を育てます。探究、留学、SDGs、ゼミなどの活動を通じて、自分の進路と社会との関わりを考えます。学習面だけでなく、日常の対話や実践を重ね、一人ひとりの目標に伴走します。二十五歳で人生の主人公として輝く人材を目標に、自ら挑戦し続ける力を養う教育です。","clubs":[{"id":11205,"name":"剣道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ikubunkan.ed.jp/assets/doc/request/pamphlet-ghs2025.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11206,"name":"硬式野球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ikubunkan.ed.jp/assets/doc/request/pamphlet-ghs2025.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11207,"name":"高校サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ikubunkan.ed.jp/assets/doc/request/pamphlet-ghs2025.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11208,"name":"柔道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ikubunkan.ed.jp/assets/doc/request/pamphlet-ghs2025.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11209,"name":"卓球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ikubunkan.ed.jp/assets/doc/request/pamphlet-ghs2025.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11210,"name":"中学サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ikubunkan.ed.jp/assets/doc/request/pamphlet-ghs2025.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11211,"name":"中学野球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ikubunkan.ed.jp/assets/doc/request/pamphlet-ghs2025.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11212,"name":"中学男女バスケ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ikubunkan.ed.jp/assets/doc/request/pamphlet-ghs2025.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11213,"name":"高校男女バスケ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ikubunkan.ed.jp/assets/doc/request/pamphlet-ghs2025.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11214,"name":"バドミントン","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ikubunkan.ed.jp/assets/doc/request/pamphlet-ghs2025.pdf","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11215,"name":"高校男子バレー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ikubunkan.ed.jp/assets/doc/request/pamphlet-ghs2025.pdf","verified_at":